hicle design and why?"},{"text":"How would you redesign an existing vehicle?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical questions"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is Alias used for?"},{"text":"What is automotive surfacing?"},{"text":"What is CMF?"},{"text":"What is clay modelling?"},{"text":"What is Class-A surfacing?"},{"text":"How does EV architecture affect vehicle design?"},{"text":"How do ergonomics influence interior design?"},{"text":"What manufacturing constraints affect automotive design?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio question"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Take us through your strongest project.\""},{"type":"p","text":"The student should explain:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Research","Ideation","Iteration","Design decision","Final outcome"]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible directions:"},{"type":"h","text":"Transportation Design"},{"type":"p","text":"For deeper automotive specialisation."},{"type":"h","text":"Industrial Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for broader product and mobility careers."},{"type":"h","text":"Interaction/UX Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automotive HMI"},{"text":"Connected vehicles"},{"text":"Digital cockpits"},{"text":"Infotainment"},{"text":"Mobility applications"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mobility / Future Transportation"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for students interested in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Autonomous vehicles"},{"text":"Smart mobility"},{"text":"Urban transportation"},{"text":"Sustainable transportation"}]}]},{"heading":"High-Value Specialist Routes","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Route A — Exterior Design"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des","Automotive Sketching","Alias","Surfacing","Exterior Designer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route B — Interior Design"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des","Interior Architecture","Ergonomics","HMI","Automotive Interior Designer"]},{"type":"h","text":"Route