,{"heading":"AI in Automobile Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly become a design exploration and productivity tool, rather than a replacement for designers."},{"type":"p","text":"Students should learn how AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Concept generation"},{"text":"Design exploration"},{"text":"Image references"},{"text":"Moodboards"},{"text":"Style exploration"},{"text":"Parametric design"},{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"3D asset generation"},{"text":"Material exploration"},{"text":"Automotive visualisation"},{"text":"Design documentation"},{"text":"Virtual prototyping"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, the designer still needs strong control over:"},{"type":"flow","items":["proportion","form","ergonomics","feasibility","brand language","manufacturing."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A student who only produces AI-generated car images without understanding vehicle design will have a weak professional profile."}]},{"heading":"Future of Automobile Design","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The field is moving beyond conventional car styling."},{"type":"p","text":"Major growth areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electric vehicles"},{"text":"Autonomous vehicles"},{"text":"Software-defined vehicles"},{"text":"Connected mobility"},{"text":"Smart interiors"},{"text":"Digital cockpits"},{"text":"Sustainable materials"},{"text":"Shared mobility"},{"text":"Autonomous shuttles"},{"text":"Urban mobility"},{"text":"Micromobility"},{"text":"Advanced manufacturing"},{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"Human-AI mobility interfaces"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The future automobile designer will increasingly work across physical product + digital experience + mobility ecosystem."}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 Career Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A designer entering the industry today could eventually work on:"},{"type":"h","text":"Traditional vehicle styling"},{"type":"flo